{"type":"standard","title":"Teresa Benitez-Thompson","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Teresa Benitez-Thompson</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q16217188","titles":{"canonical":"Teresa_Benitez-Thompson","normalized":"Teresa Benitez-Thompson","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Teresa Benitez-Thompson</span></span>"},"pageid":41139373,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1383612571","tid":"aacde767-d7b1-11f1-ba18-dea7d1f14849","timestamp":"2026-11-03T18:09:10Z","description":"American politician from Nevada","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Teresa_Benitez-Thompson"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teresa_Benitez-Thompson?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Teresa_Benitez-Thompson"}},"extract":"Teresa Francisca Benitez-Thompson is an American politician and former social worker who served in the Nevada Assembly from 2010 to 2022, representing the 27th district in Washoe County. A member of the Democratic Party, she served as majority leader of the Assembly from 2016 to 2022.","extract_html":"<p><b>Teresa Francisca Benitez-Thompson</b> is an American politician and former social worker who served in the Nevada Assembly from 2010 to 2022, representing the 27th district in Washoe County. A member of the Democratic Party, she served as majority leader of the Assembly from 2016 to 2022.</p>"}